{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411070","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1141107001:1":{"text":"Who said these highly sought-after potions didn't exist? Lots of folks just don't know quality when they see it.","source_cn":"谁说不存在所谓的畅销药剂？很多人根本就不识货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82DBEC740BC981FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1141107002:1":{"text":"Top-notch potions get overlooked... while these junk ones fly off the shelves.","source_cn":"好的药剂没人问，偏偏……咳咳，偏偏那些“下等货”反而出的快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D7B074804D5D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1141107002":{"text":"Top-notch potions get overlooked... while these junk ones fly off the shelves.","source_cn":"好的药剂没人问，偏偏……咳咳，偏偏那些“下等货”反而出的快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D7B074804D5D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141107003:1":{"text":"Well, you get what you pay for!","source_cn":"这个嘛，我只能说一分钱一分货！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7332D297C7791597","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141107005:1":{"text":"It's not just about the medicine's quality—it's about how much faith people put in what we're selling.","source_cn":"要点并不是药剂的品质，让客人相信这些药剂管用才是最关键的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x054F78DFA087DA4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141107006:1":{"text":"This is no easy task. Sometimes, you gotta grease the wheels, spread some rumors, and build a foundation through rumors and stories.","source_cn":"这可要花上不少心思，甚至还需要买通一些渠道来散播传闻，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1804F4EDA57A053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141107007:1":{"text":"And the formula must keep evolving, so no one knows exactly what's inside.","source_cn":"配方也要不停地更迭，永远让人猜不着里面装的是什么东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06BCA5B8532FFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1141107007":{"text":"And the formula must keep evolving, so no one knows exactly what's inside.","source_cn":"配方也要不停地更迭，永远让人猜不着里面装的是什么东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06BCA5B8532FFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141107008:1":{"text":"As I said earlier, that's not the point.","source_cn":"不，不不，我都说了这并不关键。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA13EB205126BE170","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141107013:1":{"text":"That's all I'll say. The rest's my trade secret.","source_cn":"到此为止了，剩下的都是商业机密。我能说的就只有这么多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EF203C834F8831A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"So what's in the potion?","source_cn":"所以药剂里到底是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF46C00DD8481B9C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So what's in the potion?","female":"So what's in the potion?","variant_male_record_index":"64720","variant_female_record_index":"64721","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141107009:1":{"text":"Of course. I take full responsibility if any problem arises. After all, I have tested them all on myself.","source_cn":"当然，完全负责，那些药都是我亲自试过的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD79C4BBC5D065763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1141107010:1":{"text":"Don't you worry. I know what lines can't be crossed.","source_cn":"别担心，我清楚什么该做，什么不该做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5346079BE105C4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"What if something goes wrong?","source_cn":"所以你该对药剂负责吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E04CC756013622F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What if something goes wrong?","female":"What if something goes wrong?","variant_male_record_index":"64722","variant_female_record_index":"64723","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1141107011:1":{"text":"Maulers are strong. Nothing serious would happen anyway.","source_cn":"蛮血们身强力壮，就算出事也不会是什么大问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A6E3953D79A706C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1141107012:1":{"text":"And even if the worst did happen, how could they prove they hadn't consumed anything besides my potions?","source_cn":"就算有的话，对方怎么证明在这段时间内只喝了我的药剂呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB40E203E4906F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:2:3":{"text":"Like unexpected side effects?","source_cn":"如果出问题了怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0ECC1B4635182D42","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Like unexpected side effects?","female":"Like unexpected side effects?","variant_male_record_index":"64724","variant_female_record_index":"64725","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"How can you tell the quality?","source_cn":"怎么区分好坏","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x823C202A1E663A1B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How can you tell the quality?","female":"How can you tell the quality?","variant_male_record_index":"64716","variant_female_record_index":"64717","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1141107004:1":{"text":"I always aim to give my customers potent stuff at fair prices. It's not just about making a buck.","source_cn":"物美价廉一向是我的宗旨，别提赚不赚钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B7D811892C7B8F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Do you profit a lot?","source_cn":"哪个更赚钱？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x94BC12A17BE38D1E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Do you profit a lot?","female":"Do you profit a lot?","variant_male_record_index":"64718","variant_female_record_index":"64719","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"Smokey","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":1}}